{"4959240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SOULLOOP", "steam_appid": 4959240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/95897a17bf12d9836d062bda2691e785.poster.avif?t=1787338788\" aria-label=\"A steampunk revolver sets a brass hall on fire, enemies burning as they fall.\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/95897a17bf12d9836d062bda2691e785.webm?t=1787338788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/95897a17bf12d9836d062bda2691e785.mp4?t=1787338788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A steampunk roguelite FPS deckbuilder. Descend the loop, spend your dead.<br><br>SOULLOOP drops you into a dying machine-world where the only way down is through. Gun through procedurally generated floors, draft cards that rewrite how your weapons work, and fuse builds the designers were too scared to ship. When you die — and you will — your souls stay banked. Spend them. Descend again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLEAR A FLOOR. TAKE A CARD. CHANGE THE GUN.</h2>Three cards after every floor. One pick. The gun in your hands is not the gun you finish the run with.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/37f00e6485429c44c30c5f0a6f8b5fd1.poster.avif?t=1787338788\" aria-label=\"The FLOOR 4 CLEARED screen: three power cards face up, a cursor weighing them, one taken.\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/37f00e6485429c44c30c5f0a6f8b5fd1.webm?t=1787338788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/37f00e6485429c44c30c5f0a6f8b5fd1.mp4?t=1787338788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>42 card families</strong>, each evolving down two forks — and the same card taken twice is not the same card<br></li><li> Seven Selves that <strong>fuse in pairs</strong> into hybrids: MUNITIONS, PRECISION, REACTION, CATACLYSM, FLESH, GUILE, QUICKSILVER<br></li><li> <strong>30 rule cards</strong> that bend the run itself, plus <strong>70+ relics</strong> that stack into nonsense<br></li><li> <strong>27 inscriptions</strong> and the Tempering House — reforge a mediocre draw into a weapon</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DECK REWRITES THE GUN</h2>This is the whole pitch in one image. A stock revolver, then the same revolver wired for chain lightning. Then the saw thrower, before and after it starts freezing what it hits. It is not one gun's gimmick — it is the rule.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/bb136b4779ad9e2fe66db488912dd289.poster.avif?t=1787338788\" aria-label=\"The same revolver before and after its cards, then the same saw thrower, with a burst of card art between each pair.\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/bb136b4779ad9e2fe66db488912dd289.webm?t=1787338788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/bb136b4779ad9e2fe66db488912dd289.mp4?t=1787338788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GUN FOR EVERY MOOD</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>8 weapons</strong>, from THE LAST RITE to CAPACITOR CHOIR — every one has a signature mechanic, not just a damage number<br></li><li> <strong>31 right-click Vent abilities</strong>, including forge-only variants and redline-only Master Vents<br></li><li> The <strong>ABSOLVE</strong> finisher, and a hammer you can throw when subtlety fails</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/9c0ac713348fc2a54c6a415aa429ffb6.poster.avif?t=1787338788\" aria-label=\"A chaingun, then a flamethrower in a red hell plaza, ending on a melee execution.\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/9c0ac713348fc2a54c6a415aa429ffb6.webm?t=1787338788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/9c0ac713348fc2a54c6a415aa429ffb6.mp4?t=1787338788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EIGHTEEN FLOORS, SIX ACTS, ONE WAY DOWN</h2>The Showroom. The Toxic Refinery. The Frozen Reactor. The Bone Cathedral. The Furnace. The Heliosol Core.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/803cef6784d4c7e176a055a73dedf22b.poster.avif?t=1787338788\" aria-label=\"Six labelled biomes in sequence — the Showroom, Toxic Refinery, Frozen Reactor, Bone Cathedral, Furnace and Corrupted.\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/803cef6784d4c7e176a055a73dedf22b.webm?t=1787338788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/803cef6784d4c7e176a055a73dedf22b.mp4?t=1787338788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Over <strong>30 enemy types</strong>, <strong>6 minibosses</strong> and <strong>6 bosses</strong> with phases, telegraphs and weaknesses worth learning<br></li><li> Procedural floors on a seed — and a <strong>Daily Trial</strong>, one loop, everyone, the same odds</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEATH IS A DEPOSIT</h2>You will not clear the loop on your first descent. You are not supposed to. Every death banks souls, and souls buy permanence — the Soul Forge is a constellation of <strong>130+ nodes across eight signs</strong> that carries forward into every run you ever start.<br><br>[hr][/hr]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARLY ACCESS</h2>SOULLOOP is in active development. Buying in Early Access is the cheapest the game will ever be, and your feedback directly shapes the feel pass, onboarding and content order. The full roadmap is in the Early Access section at the top of this page.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A NOTE ON AI</h2>Some art and audio in SOULLOOP were made with AI assistance under human direction. Every system, every card, every line of code and all the balance are hand-built. Nothing is generated while you play.", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/95897a17bf12d9836d062bda2691e785.poster.avif?t=1787338788\" aria-label=\"A steampunk revolver sets a brass hall on fire, enemies burning as they fall.\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/95897a17bf12d9836d062bda2691e785.webm?t=1787338788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959240/extras/95897a17bf12d9836d062bda2691e785.mp4?t=1787338788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A steampunk roguelite FPS deckbuilder. Descend the loop, spend your dead.<br><br>SOULLOOP drops you into a dying machine-world where the only way down is through. Gun through procedurally generated floors, draft cards that rewrite how your weapons work, and fuse build